## 6. Boundaries

The register row names a probe census defect: a shard with no hub_tip
row raises after every data line flushes. This parse reads the
per-row and SPLIT lines, the same lines the merge reads, so no count
moves.

Verdict: the signed set verifies. The draft folds section 3.1 and
section 5 to 30 and 2.
